problems.q:
DEPARTMENT(DeptID, DeptName) = (10, Accounting) (20, Sales) (30, Account Support), EMPLOYEE(EmpID, EmpName, DeptID) = (1, Kim, 10) (2, Lee, 20) (3, Park, 30) (4, Choi, 10) (5, Han, NULL)이다. 다음 질의의 결과로 옳은 것은?
SELECT EmpName FROM EMPLOYEE
WHERE DeptID IN (SELECT DeptID FROM DEPARTMENT WHERE DeptName LIKE 'Account%');
